{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15212380","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15212380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1521238001:0":{"text":"부상이 꽤 심하군. 일어날 수 있겠나?","source_cn":"伤得不轻。还能站起来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9ACFCEA3BF5F16F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521238002:0":{"text":"지, 지혈하고 붕대만 잘 감으면... 괜찮을 겁니다!","source_cn":"只……只要止住血，包扎好伤口……应该就没问题！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94C4CCEFDE645A0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521238003:0":{"text":"상처 크기로 봐서는 그렇게 낙관하기는 어려울 것 같은데.","source_cn":"你这伤口的大小，恐怕不能这么乐观。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC753B655345E3EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521238004:0":{"text":"그래. 선발에서 빠져서 상처 치료에 전념하도록. 사냥대 선발은 이번 한 번만이 아니니 무리하지 마라.","source_cn":"没错，我建议你先退出选拔养伤吧。狩猎队的选拔不止一次，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90B0AEEE49A9E162","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521238005:0":{"text":"맞아. 너같이 약한 녀석은...","source_cn":"是啊，像你这样的弱者……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10AB24077F69367D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521238006:0":{"text":"...난 약하지 않아!","source_cn":"——我才不是弱者！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6128672826AD08FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521238007:0":{"text":"센로 님, 수스. 전 괜찮아요. 더 할 수 있어요... 물러나지 않을 거예요!","source_cn":"森绒，索斯，我没事，我还能坚持……我不要退出！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFE43600CD5EB615","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521238008:0":{"text":"그리고 처음 참가하는 선발이니까... 무슨 일이 있어도 끝까지 버틸 거예요!","source_cn":"而且这是我第一次参加选拔……无论如何我都要坚持到最后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A53D014F6057E15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521238009:1":{"text":"...고집을 부리는 게 능사는 아니야.","source_cn":"……太固执也不是什么好事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFEA7AA4BDDE17ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521238010:1":{"text":"고집이 아니에요... 이건 끝까지 해내려는 거예요. 아버지께서 가르쳐 주신 거죠.","source_cn":"不是固执……这是坚持！我老爹一直教训我要有坚持的毅力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D30115C3FCCF474","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1521238010":{"text":"고집이 아니에요... 이